# ~/.vimrc symlink + vim-plug bootstrap + headless PlugInstall (warn-only on fail).
# Single config: vim/vimrc covers terminal vim and MacVim/gvim (GUI via GUIEnter).
# Preserves any pre-existing ~/.vimrc as ~/.vimrc.bak.<timestamp> (and a copy under
# ~/.local/state/init-files/vim-backup/). Retires ~/.gvimrc the same way so it
# cannot override the one-file model. Does not delete ~/.vim contents.
